# SysEdit: a line typed into AUTOEXEC.BAT and saved, child 2 (WIN.INI) chosen from the Window menu,
# two lines typed into it and saved, Exit. The files left on C: (AUTOEXEC.BAT, its backup
# AUTOEXEC.SYD, WIN.INI and WIN.SYD) must equal what real 3.11 wrote, and no temporary file is left
# reference: scn/mdi-edit.scn (frames 02-04; the frames after each save equal the ones before but
# for the caret, which the rig does not record)
# regress: sh apps/sysedit/tests/sysedit.sh "$TEST" "$OUT" mdi-edit
# compare: mdi-edit/02.png 02.png active ignore 316 228 333 261
# compare: mdi-edit/03.png 03.png active ignore 316 228 333 261
# compare: mdi-edit/04.png 04.png active ignore 316 228 333 261
# ini: WIN.INI arch311 mdi=1
sleep 500
type rem arch311
key enter
sleep 300
shotcaret shots/02.png
key alt
key f
key s
sleep 300
key alt
key w
key 2
sleep 300
shotcaret shots/03.png
type [arch311]
key enter
type mdi=1
key enter
sleep 300
shotcaret shots/04.png
key alt
key f
key s
sleep 300
key alt
key f
key x
quit
